<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<rdf:RDF
   xmlns:owl="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#"
   xmlns:rdf="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#"
   xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#"
>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://example.org/ontology/custom/soccer#season">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://example.org/ontology/custom/soccer#Competition"/>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="ko">시즌</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Season</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">대회의 시즌을 2026 또는 2025-2026 같은 연도 표기로 기록한다.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">The season of the competition as a year such as 2026 or 2025-2026.</rdfs:comment>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://example.org/ontology/custom/soccer#forClub">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://example.org/ontology/custom/soccer#Appearance"/>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="https://example.org/ontology/custom/soccer#Club"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="ko">출전 클럽</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">For club</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">선수가 그 경기에서 소속으로 뛴 클럽을 연결한다. 경기의 홈 또는 원정 클럽이어야 한다.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Links an appearance to the club the player played for in that match, which must be the home or away club.</rdfs:comment>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://example.org/ontology/custom/soccer#lineupRole">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://example.org/ontology/custom/soccer#Appearance"/>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="ko">명단 역할</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Lineup role</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">starter(선발), substitute(교체 출전), unused-substitute(출전하지 않은 교체 대기) 중 하나이다.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">One of starter, substitute (came on) or unused-substitute.</rdfs:comment>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://example.org/ontology/custom/soccer#inCompetition">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://example.org/ontology/custom/soccer#Match"/>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="https://example.org/ontology/custom/soccer#Competition"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="ko">소속 대회</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">In competition</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">경기가 속한 대회를 연결한다. 경기는 대회 하나에만 속한다.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Links a match to the competition it belongs to; a match belongs to exactly one competition.</rdfs:comment>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://example.org/ontology/custom/soccer#substitutionLimit">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://example.org/ontology/custom/soccer#Competition"/>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="ko">교체 허용 인원</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Substitution limit</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">한 클럽이 한 경기에서 교체 출전시킬 수 있는 선수의 최대 수이며 1명 이상 11명 이하이다.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">The maximum number of substitutes one club may bring on in a match, from 1 to 11.</rdfs:comment>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://example.org/ontology/custom/soccer#awayClub">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://example.org/ontology/custom/soccer#Match"/>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="https://example.org/ontology/custom/soccer#Club"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="ko">원정 클럽</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Away club</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">경기의 원정 클럽을 연결한다. 홈 클럽과 달라야 한다.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Links a match to its away club, which must differ from the home club.</rdfs:comment>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://example.org/ontology/custom/soccer#eventType">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://example.org/ontology/custom/soccer#MatchEvent"/>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="ko">사건 종류</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Event type</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">goal(득점), own-goal(자책골), yellow-card(경고), red-card(퇴장) 중 하나이다. 퇴장당한 선수는 그 뒤 사건이 없어야 한다.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">One of goal, own-goal, yellow-card or red-card; a sent-off player has no later events.</rdfs:comment>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://example.org/ontology/custom/soccer#competitionType">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://example.org/ontology/custom/soccer#Competition"/>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="ko">대회 종류</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Competition type</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">대회가 league(리그)인지 cup(토너먼트)인지 기록한다.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Whether the competition is a league or a cup.</rdfs:comment>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://example.org/ontology/custom/soccer#minuteIn">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://example.org/ontology/custom/soccer#Appearance"/>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="ko">투입 분</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Minute in</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">교체 출전한 선수가 경기에 들어간 분이다. 교체 출전에만 있고 다른 역할에는 없다.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">The minute a substitute came on; present only for substitutes.</rdfs:comment>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://example.org/ontology/custom/soccer#Match">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="ko">경기</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Match</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">홈 클럽과 원정 클럽이 치르는 경기 하나이다. 예정, 종료, 연기 상태를 구분하며 종료된 경기에만 결과와 사건이 있다.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">One match between a home and an away club, distinguishing scheduled, finished and postponed states; only a finished match has a result and events.</rdfs:comment>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://example.org/ontology/custom/soccer#byPlayer">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://example.org/ontology/custom/soccer#MatchEvent"/>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="https://example.org/ontology/custom/soccer#Player"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="ko">사건 선수</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">By player</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">사건을 일으킨 선수를 연결한다. 그 경기에 실제로 출전한 선수여야 한다.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Links an event to the player who caused it, who must actually have played in that match.</rdfs:comment>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://example.org/ontology/custom/soccer#Competition">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="ko">대회</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Competition</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">한 시즌의 리그나 컵 대회이다. 경기마다 허용되는 교체 선수의 수가 대회마다 다르다.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A league or cup competition in one season; the number of substitutes allowed per match differs between competitions.</rdfs:comment>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://example.org/ontology/custom/soccer#Appearance">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="ko">출전 기록</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Appearance</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">한 선수가 한 경기에서 한 클럽 소속으로 맡은 역할이다. 선발, 교체 출전, 출전하지 않은 교체 대기를 구분한다.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">The role one player had in one match for one club: starter, substitute who came on, or unused substitute.</rdfs:comment>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://example.org/ontology/custom/soccer#position">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://example.org/ontology/custom/soccer#Appearance"/>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="ko">포지션</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Position</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">그 경기에서 맡은 포지션을 goalkeeper, defender, midfielder, forward 중 하나로 기록한다.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">The position played in that match: goalkeeper, defender, midfielder or forward.</rdfs:comment>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://example.org/ontology/custom/soccer#matchStatus">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://example.org/ontology/custom/soccer#Match"/>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="ko">경기 상태</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Match status</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">scheduled(예정), finished(종료), postponed(연기) 중 하나이며 종료에는 결과와 경기 보고서가 필요하다.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">One of scheduled, finished or postponed; finished requires a result and a match report.</rdfs:comment>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://example.org/ontology/custom/soccer#forPlayer">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://example.org/ontology/custom/soccer#Appearance"/>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="https://example.org/ontology/custom/soccer#Player"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="ko">출전 선수</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">For player</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">출전 기록이 어느 선수의 것인지 연결한다. 한 선수는 한 경기에 한 번만 기록된다.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Links an appearance to the player; a player has only one appearance per match.</rdfs:comment>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://example.org/ontology/custom/soccer">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Ontology"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="ko">축구 온톨로지</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Soccer ontology</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">축구의 클럽, 선수, 대회, 경기, 출전 명단과 득점·경고·퇴장 같은 경기 사건을 연결한다. 종료된 경기는 경기 보고서 증빙과 일치하는 득점 사건, 11명의 선발 명단과 골키퍼 한 명을 요구한다. 예제는 가상의 클럽과 선수만 담는다.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Connects clubs, players, competitions, matches, lineups and match events such as goals, cautions and sending-offs. A finished match requires a match report, goal events that agree with the score, eleven starters per side and one starting goalkeeper. The example contains only fictional clubs and players.</rdfs:comment>
    <owl:versionIRI rdf:resource="https://example.org/ontology/custom/soccer/0.1.0"/>
    <owl:versionInfo>0.1.0</owl:versionInfo>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://example.org/ontology/custom/soccer#minuteOut">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://example.org/ontology/custom/soccer#Appearance"/>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="ko">교체·퇴장 분</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Minute out</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">선수가 교체되거나 퇴장당해 경기를 떠난 분이다. 투입 분보다 늦어야 하며 끝까지 뛴 선수에는 없다.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">The minute a player left the match, substituted or sent off; later than the minute in, and absent if the player finished the match.</rdfs:comment>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://example.org/ontology/custom/soccer#matchReportUri">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://example.org/ontology/custom/soccer#Match"/>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#anyURI"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="ko">경기 보고서 주소</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Match report URI</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">종료된 경기의 결과를 확인할 수 있는 경기 보고서의 위치이며 문서의 진위를 자동으로 보증하지 않는다.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Points to the match report behind a finished result; authenticity is not verified automatically.</rdfs:comment>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://example.org/ontology/custom/soccer#matchday">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://example.org/ontology/custom/soccer#Match"/>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="ko">라운드</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Matchday</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">리그의 몇 번째 라운드 경기인지 나타내는 1 이상의 정수이며 컵 경기에는 없을 수 있다.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">The round number within a league, an integer from 1; a cup match may have none.</rdfs:comment>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://example.org/ontology/custom/soccer#homeGoals">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://example.org/ontology/custom/soccer#Match"/>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="ko">홈 득점</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Home goals</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">종료된 경기에서 홈 클럽의 득점 수이며 홈 클럽 득점 사건의 수와 같아야 한다. 자책골은 상대 클럽의 득점이다.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">The home club's goals in a finished match, equal to the number of goal events credited to it; an own goal is credited to the opponent.</rdfs:comment>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://example.org/ontology/custom/soccer#homeClub">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://example.org/ontology/custom/soccer#Match"/>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="https://example.org/ontology/custom/soccer#Club"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="ko">홈 클럽</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Home club</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">경기의 홈 클럽을 연결한다. 원정 클럽과 달라야 한다.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Links a match to its home club, which must differ from the away club.</rdfs:comment>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://example.org/ontology/custom/soccer#hasEvent">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://example.org/ontology/custom/soccer#Match"/>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="https://example.org/ontology/custom/soccer#MatchEvent"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="ko">경기 사건 연결</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Has event</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">경기 중 일어난 사건을 연결한다. 사건은 한 경기에만 속한다.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Links a match to one of its events; an event belongs to exactly one match.</rdfs:comment>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://example.org/ontology/custom/soccer#matchDate">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://example.org/ontology/custom/soccer#Match"/>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="ko">경기일</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Match date</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">경기가 열리거나 열릴 예정인 날짜이다. 연기된 경기는 원래 예정일을 유지한다.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">The date the match is or was scheduled; a postponed match keeps its original date.</rdfs:comment>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://example.org/ontology/custom/soccer#Player">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="ko">선수</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Player</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">경기에 출전하는 축구 선수이다. 이름 같은 개인정보 없이 가명 표시만 기록하며 소속은 경기별 출전 기록으로 나타낸다.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A footballer who plays in matches; only a pseudonymous label is kept and club membership is shown per match by appearances.</rdfs:comment>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://example.org/ontology/custom/soccer#shirtNumber">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://example.org/ontology/custom/soccer#Appearance"/>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="ko">등번호</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Shirt number</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">그 경기에서 입은 등번호이며 1에서 99 사이이고 같은 경기 같은 클럽에서 겹칠 수 없다.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">The shirt number worn in that match, from 1 to 99, unique within a club in a match.</rdfs:comment>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://example.org/ontology/custom/soccer#hasAppearance">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://example.org/ontology/custom/soccer#Match"/>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="https://example.org/ontology/custom/soccer#Appearance"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="ko">출전 기록 연결</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Has appearance</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">경기의 출전 기록을 연결한다. 출전 기록은 한 경기에만 속한다.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Links a match to one of its appearance records; an appearance belongs to exactly one match.</rdfs:comment>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://example.org/ontology/custom/soccer#MatchEvent">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="ko">경기 사건</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Match event</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">경기 중 특정 분에 선수가 일으킨 득점, 자책골, 경고, 퇴장 같은 사건이다.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An event caused by a player at a given minute of a match, such as a goal, own goal, yellow card or red card.</rdfs:comment>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://example.org/ontology/custom/soccer#awayGoals">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://example.org/ontology/custom/soccer#Match"/>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="ko">원정 득점</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Away goals</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">종료된 경기에서 원정 클럽의 득점 수이며 원정 클럽 득점 사건의 수와 같아야 한다.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">The away club's goals in a finished match, equal to the number of goal events credited to it.</rdfs:comment>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://example.org/ontology/custom/soccer#eventMinute">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://example.org/ontology/custom/soccer#MatchEvent"/>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="ko">사건 분</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Event minute</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">사건이 일어난 경기 시간으로 1분에서 130분 사이의 정수이다. 추가 시간은 90분 뒤의 정수로 적는다.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">The match minute of the event, an integer from 1 to 130; stoppage time is written as an integer after 90.</rdfs:comment>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://example.org/ontology/custom/soccer#Club">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="ko">클럽</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Club</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">경기에 출전하는 축구 클럽이나 팀이다. 선수 이적과 소속 이력은 다루지 않는다.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A football club or team that plays matches; player transfers and contract histories are not modelled.</rdfs:comment>
  </rdf:Description>
</rdf:RDF>
